WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.519
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.789 --> 01:43.060
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.110 --> 01:43.740
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.740 --> 01:45.930
[Episode 26]

5
01:47.789 --> 01:48.590
Look.

6
01:48.590 --> 01:49.120
This...

7
01:53.680 --> 01:54.710
The Dragon King has manifested!

8
01:54.710 --> 01:56.509
The Dragon King has manifested!

9
01:56.680 --> 01:57.789
The Dragon King has manifested!

10
01:57.789 --> 01:59.590
The Dragon King has manifested!

11
01:59.789 --> 02:01.590
The Dragon King has manifested!

12
02:03.310 --> 02:04.000
Oh no.

13
02:07.950 --> 02:08.800
Don't panic, Your Highness.

14
02:08.800 --> 02:10.600
The Grand Heir Apparent is safe.

15
02:11.430 --> 02:12.630
Grand Heir Apparent!

16
02:12.630 --> 02:13.490
Your Highness.

17
02:15.430 --> 02:16.430
-Your Highness. -Your Highness.

18
02:16.430 --> 02:17.240
Ye.

19
02:21.870 --> 02:22.800
What's going on?

20
02:22.960 --> 02:23.970
There's no blood.

21
02:26.840 --> 02:27.840
Your Highness...

22
02:29.030 --> 02:30.560
The Grand Heir Apparent...

23
02:31.630 --> 02:33.520
He has been dead for a long time.

24
02:35.910 --> 02:36.710
Speak!

25
02:37.240 --> 02:38.630
Who sent you?

26
02:38.630 --> 02:40.079
The Crown Prince is incompetent

27
02:40.079 --> 02:41.710
and wants to succeed to the throne through his son.

28
02:41.710 --> 02:43.430
Now that the Grand Heir Apparent is dead,

29
02:43.430 --> 02:44.740
the world of Great Shi

30
02:44.770 --> 02:46.400
will ultimately belong to His Highness Prince Ding.

31
02:46.400 --> 02:47.240
Lies.

32
02:47.840 --> 02:48.630
Speak.

33
02:49.470 --> 02:51.600
What is your relationship with Liluo?

34
03:01.430 --> 03:03.120
First Prince Zhou Miao

35
03:03.520 --> 03:05.080
ordered assassins

36
03:05.120 --> 03:06.650
to murder his royal nephew.

37
03:07.310 --> 03:08.590
His wild ambitions

38
03:08.590 --> 03:10.000
are glaringly obvious!

39
03:10.240 --> 03:11.430
It is an unforgivable crime!

40
03:11.430 --> 03:12.360
Huo Daozhang!

41
03:13.590 --> 03:16.070
The Crown Prince ordered you to escort the body here

42
03:16.070 --> 03:17.520
for this exact moment.

43
03:18.310 --> 03:20.280
You used Zhou Ye's corpse as bait

44
03:20.910 --> 03:23.050
to lure the First Prince into a trap

45
03:23.240 --> 03:25.030
before sending assassins here.

46
03:25.030 --> 03:26.630
Once the crime is confirmed,

47
03:27.030 --> 03:28.430
His Highness Prince Ding

48
03:28.630 --> 03:30.760
will never have a chance to rise again.

49
03:41.000 --> 03:43.120
Your Highness!

50
03:43.590 --> 03:45.450
The great cause is accomplished.

51
03:46.030 --> 03:48.350
I have done my duty

52
03:49.079 --> 03:50.010
with no regrets.

53
03:51.120 --> 03:53.470
To think the Crown Prince is so ruthless

54
03:54.190 --> 03:55.750
to his own flesh and blood.

55
03:55.910 --> 03:56.710
No.

56
03:57.910 --> 04:00.590
When we welcomed the Grand Heir Apparent that day,

57
04:00.590 --> 04:01.910
he was perfectly fine.

58
04:32.680 --> 04:33.480
You...

59
04:39.830 --> 04:40.720
Lord Huo.

60
04:41.000 --> 04:43.530
When you served as the Vice Minister of Works,

61
04:44.390 --> 04:45.990
Tang Yiming once personally taught you

62
04:45.990 --> 04:47.850
the art of intricate mechanisms.

63
04:47.920 --> 04:49.310
Using mechanical devices

64
04:49.310 --> 04:50.920
to control a corpse

65
04:52.190 --> 04:54.390
shouldn't be difficult for you, right?

66
05:12.040 --> 05:13.070
Huo Daozhang.

67
05:14.270 --> 05:16.040
How will you explain such dirty deeds

68
05:16.040 --> 05:17.580
to His Majesty in the future?

69
05:17.580 --> 05:18.930
Prince Ping,

70
05:19.270 --> 05:21.560
you are too naive.

71
05:21.800 --> 05:24.310
If the Grand Heir Apparent's corpse is destroyed,

72
05:24.310 --> 05:25.770
there will be no evidence.

73
05:26.270 --> 05:27.870
Why would we need to explain?

74
05:31.040 --> 05:32.360
Master Yun Hai!

75
05:35.040 --> 05:36.159
Come out.

76
05:40.040 --> 05:42.310
Master, your martial arts skills are exceptional.

77
05:42.310 --> 05:44.830
Help me destroy the Grand Heir Apparent's corpse,

78
05:44.830 --> 05:45.920
and the Crown Prince

79
05:45.920 --> 05:47.870
can rest easy with no worries.

80
05:48.390 --> 05:50.720
All the evil karma created in the past

81
05:51.120 --> 05:54.250
stems from beginningless greed, anger, and ignorance.

82
06:00.510 --> 06:01.390
Lord Huo.

83
06:02.040 --> 06:03.950
When did I ever promise

84
06:04.270 --> 06:05.800
to help you?

85
06:06.070 --> 06:06.870
Master,

86
06:07.870 --> 06:09.120
what do you mean?

87
06:09.120 --> 06:11.630
When you pledged allegiance to the Crown Prince,

88
06:11.630 --> 06:13.040
you clearly promised

89
06:13.040 --> 06:14.320
to do your utmost

90
06:14.350 --> 06:16.350
to help him succeed to the throne!

91
06:16.680 --> 06:17.480
Now,

92
06:17.800 --> 06:19.680
are you going back on your word?

93
06:19.720 --> 06:21.730
The one who promised you back then

94
06:22.040 --> 06:23.190
was Yun Hai,

95
06:23.870 --> 06:25.160
not me.

96
06:25.190 --> 06:26.040
You...

97
06:29.190 --> 06:30.670
You are not Yun Hai?

98
06:30.870 --> 06:32.430
Of course he's not Yun Hai.

99
06:37.720 --> 06:39.920
He's the shadow puppeteer who fell off a cliff 6 years ago

100
06:39.920 --> 06:41.310
and became a vengeful spirit,

101
06:41.310 --> 06:44.000
seeking revenge for his wife and child,

102
06:44.310 --> 06:45.310
Yin Jie.

103
07:04.190 --> 07:09.600
Flat hands, flat feet, a body flat as can be.

104
07:10.800 --> 07:14.920
Yet it claims to be human, not a shadow.

105
07:16.510 --> 07:22.300
Is it a puppet performing shadow play,

106
07:22.870 --> 07:29.360
or a shadow puppet wearing human skin?

107
07:36.430 --> 07:38.270
Stop playing tricks here.

108
07:38.680 --> 07:41.040
Turning into a vengeful spirit for revenge,

109
07:41.040 --> 07:42.430
cutting out hearts and livers,

110
07:42.430 --> 07:43.920
and confusing people's minds...

111
07:43.920 --> 07:45.600
It was you who gave Liluo's Dark Night

112
07:45.600 --> 07:46.750
the idea, right?

113
07:47.630 --> 07:49.190
On the night of the lunar eclipse,

114
07:49.190 --> 07:51.120
the ones who caused chaos with shadow puppets,

115
07:51.120 --> 07:52.630
set up an illusion formation,

116
07:52.630 --> 07:54.240
and put on a show of false strength

117
07:54.240 --> 07:56.310
were also you

118
07:56.630 --> 07:57.960
and Liluo's Dark Night.

119
07:58.830 --> 08:00.160
He's Yin Jie?

120
08:01.040 --> 08:02.630
If Yin Jie were still alive,

121
08:03.630 --> 08:05.480
he wouldn't be an old man.

122
08:06.120 --> 08:07.630
It's because of the Frost Moth.

123
08:07.630 --> 08:08.920
If the Frost Moth is in a dead body,

124
08:08.920 --> 08:09.800
it can preserve it.

125
08:09.800 --> 08:11.160
But if it's in a living body,

126
08:11.160 --> 08:12.430
it will suck their essence and blood,

127
08:12.430 --> 08:14.030
causing them to age rapidly.

128
08:14.480 --> 08:15.480
For so many years,

129
08:15.870 --> 08:17.020
the Frost Moth must have been

130
08:17.020 --> 08:18.070
kept in his body.

131
08:18.630 --> 08:20.390
Yun Hai was in seclusion for over 20 years.

132
08:20.390 --> 08:21.830
Even if he took his place,

133
08:22.120 --> 08:23.720
no one would suspect a thing.

134
08:24.040 --> 08:27.260
Everyone loved my shadow plays,

135
08:27.630 --> 08:30.410
but when my wife and child suffered,

136
08:30.630 --> 08:33.030
no one helped!

137
08:33.240 --> 08:35.620
I killed the murderers for revenge,

138
08:35.669 --> 08:37.750
but they treated me as a sinner

139
08:37.789 --> 08:39.030
and hunted me down!

140
08:39.030 --> 08:40.190
But tell me!

141
08:49.240 --> 08:52.020
What crime did I commit?

142
08:52.630 --> 08:53.960
In this world,

143
08:55.120 --> 08:57.320
right and wrong have long been confused,

144
08:57.320 --> 08:59.470
and black and white reversed!

145
09:00.440 --> 09:01.320
Then...

146
09:05.200 --> 09:07.670
Let it all be destroyed...

147
09:08.270 --> 09:10.180
The divine dragon treads the sea,

148
09:10.480 --> 09:12.700
turning the earth into the sky!

149
09:29.320 --> 09:30.930
Changlai Bun Shop.

150
09:30.950 --> 09:33.240
I assume you have all been there.

151
09:33.630 --> 09:34.870
Now do you know

152
09:35.000 --> 09:38.440
why those people acted up?

153
09:41.080 --> 09:42.280
It's the water vapor.

154
09:44.150 --> 09:45.050
Here they are,

155
09:45.080 --> 09:46.870
freshly steamed buns.

156
09:52.270 --> 09:54.630
The steamers in the bun shop produced the steam.

157
09:54.630 --> 09:55.830
And the herb gatherer

158
09:55.870 --> 09:58.200
was affected by the mist in the mountains.

159
09:59.320 --> 10:01.120
It's all because of water vapor.

160
10:01.400 --> 10:03.480
I also need a magical artifact and incantation

161
10:03.480 --> 10:04.960
to awaken the Chiying bugs.

162
10:04.960 --> 10:07.090
Those people were just an experiment.

163
10:07.120 --> 10:09.770
I added Chiying bugs into the Dragon Pond.

164
10:10.080 --> 10:11.910
Once the mist covers the area.

165
10:13.240 --> 10:15.170
anyone who has drunk the holy water

166
10:15.480 --> 10:17.870
will act up and die.

167
10:18.200 --> 10:19.250
By then,

168
10:19.840 --> 10:21.470
the entire Gutan County

169
10:21.550 --> 10:23.750
will become a living hell.

170
10:24.000 --> 10:24.790
This

171
10:26.320 --> 10:29.030
is the blessing that His Highness the Grand Heir Apparent

172
10:29.030 --> 10:32.030
has sought for our Great Shi Dynasty.

173
10:34.870 --> 10:36.960
You were a citizen of Great Shi,

174
10:37.750 --> 10:39.610
but you colluded with the enemies

175
10:39.670 --> 10:41.870
to destroy the foundation of Great Shi.

176
10:42.270 --> 10:44.040
I will fight you to the death!

177
10:54.320 --> 10:56.080
I'm sorry, Crown Prince...

178
10:57.340 --> 11:00.590
I'm sorry, Great Shi...

179
11:00.960 --> 11:01.840
Yin Jie!

180
11:10.220 --> 11:12.600
[Golden Dragon Hall]

181
11:13.960 --> 11:14.910
Yan, be careful.

182
11:15.030 --> 11:17.560
This person's martial arts are very bizarre.

183
11:56.240 --> 11:57.480
Why is Yin Jie's inner power

184
11:57.480 --> 11:59.120
so similar to

185
11:59.320 --> 12:00.580
Meng Rui's sword aura?

186
12:38.270 --> 12:39.440
Yin Jie.

187
12:40.360 --> 12:42.460
You only know how to hate people,

188
12:42.670 --> 12:43.600
but you yourself

189
12:44.240 --> 12:46.440
are also blinded by hatred.

190
12:46.910 --> 12:49.390
You keep talking about karma,

191
12:50.030 --> 12:51.510
but you must not know

192
12:51.910 --> 12:53.000
that your son

193
12:53.080 --> 12:54.750
is still alive in this world.

194
12:59.480 --> 13:00.630
But he has likely

195
13:01.510 --> 13:02.620
already drunk

196
13:02.650 --> 13:04.560
the holy water you poisoned.

197
13:05.080 --> 13:06.180
This is the Golden Dragon Pavilion holy water

198
13:06.180 --> 13:07.610
that Uncle Huang specially asked someone

199
13:07.610 --> 13:09.060
to get for you.

200
13:10.140 --> 13:10.730
Hong,

201
13:10.760 --> 13:11.730
drink it all in one gulp.

202
13:11.730 --> 13:12.900
It will keep you healthy

203
13:12.900 --> 13:14.240
and help you grow up safely.

204
13:14.240 --> 13:15.690
Thank you, Uncle Huang.

205
13:16.710 --> 13:18.410
My son...

206
13:23.190 --> 13:23.990
No.

207
13:25.550 --> 13:26.630
Impossible!

208
13:27.550 --> 13:29.550
My Hong is already dead!

209
13:29.670 --> 13:30.880
You're lying to me!

210
13:44.440 --> 13:46.080
My Hong...

211
13:47.750 --> 13:49.650
And my Yu'er...

212
13:52.720 --> 13:53.510
They

213
13:54.720 --> 13:55.910
are all dead.

214
13:58.960 --> 14:00.120
All dead.

215
14:00.150 --> 14:01.080
You fool!

216
14:03.030 --> 14:04.320
Your son was saved by Boss Huang

217
14:04.320 --> 14:05.670
of the Xiangrui Shadow Puppet Shop.

218
14:05.670 --> 14:06.730
But what did you do?

219
14:07.360 --> 14:09.490
You did something so terrible to them!

220
14:39.560 --> 14:43.070
[Golden Dragon Hall]

221
15:00.080 --> 15:01.320
Hong.

222
15:01.480 --> 15:03.260
My good Hong.

223
15:12.650 --> 15:13.740
Come here.

224
15:14.870 --> 15:15.670
Slow down.

225
15:18.630 --> 15:19.510
Are you tired?

226
15:20.720 --> 15:23.080
My good Hong...

227
15:39.360 --> 15:40.150
Yu'er...

228
15:41.200 --> 15:42.510
Hong, Hong.

229
15:43.240 --> 15:44.080
My...

230
15:48.480 --> 15:51.910
I'm coming to find you.

231
16:07.030 --> 16:08.150
H-How...

232
16:08.670 --> 16:10.010
How did that happen?

233
16:10.390 --> 16:11.200
How did it...

234
16:17.730 --> 16:19.710
[Golden Dragon Hall]

235
16:19.320 --> 16:20.250
What's going on?

236
16:44.150 --> 16:46.150
So the core of the mechanism is here.

237
16:49.870 --> 16:51.390
Meng Rui, Yan,

238
16:51.480 --> 16:52.240
try to

239
16:52.240 --> 16:53.870
destroy the dragon head directly.

240
16:53.870 --> 16:54.870
I'll find a way

241
16:55.080 --> 16:56.440
to stop the mechanism.

242
16:57.030 --> 16:57.870
Okay.

243
16:57.870 --> 16:58.670
Be careful.

244
17:03.480 --> 17:04.270
Zhu!

245
17:13.750 --> 17:14.720
I have an idea.

246
18:15.240 --> 18:16.440
Divine Constable Li.

247
18:23.270 --> 18:24.130
Your Highness.

248
18:25.240 --> 18:26.790
You must never again

249
18:27.440 --> 18:29.110
disregard your own safety like this.

250
18:29.110 --> 18:31.310
Thank you, Divine Constable Qingyang.

251
18:55.270 --> 18:56.130
Your Highness.

252
18:57.480 --> 18:58.550
My condolences.

253
19:00.480 --> 19:02.740
I promised him before that I would return

254
19:03.440 --> 19:04.700
to the palace this year

255
19:06.070 --> 19:08.070
to stay up for the New Year together.

256
19:16.350 --> 19:17.160
Ye.

257
19:18.720 --> 19:20.640
I failed to protect you.

258
19:23.720 --> 19:25.200
I'm sorry.

259
19:33.640 --> 19:34.500
Your Highness.

260
19:37.640 --> 19:39.110
This is not your fault.

261
19:40.880 --> 19:42.810
It's all the Crown Prince's doing.

262
19:43.830 --> 19:46.090
As the father of the Grand Heir Apparent,

263
19:47.270 --> 19:48.400
not only did he fail to protect

264
19:48.400 --> 19:49.550
his own son,

265
19:50.070 --> 19:52.200
but he even used him.

266
19:54.750 --> 19:56.920
He is completely unfit to be a father.

267
20:01.070 --> 20:02.000
Ms. Bai,

268
20:04.830 --> 20:05.830
have you found out

269
20:07.440 --> 20:09.160
how exactly Ye died?

270
20:10.350 --> 20:11.510
Your Highness,

271
20:12.270 --> 20:13.200
just now,

272
20:13.550 --> 20:15.270
I found multiple traces of poisoning

273
20:15.270 --> 20:17.550
on the Grand Heir Apparent's body.

274
20:18.160 --> 20:19.880
But whether he was actually poisoned

275
20:19.880 --> 20:21.070
and, if so, by what,

276
20:21.160 --> 20:22.680
requires

277
20:23.030 --> 20:24.290
further examination.

278
20:25.680 --> 20:26.550
Poisoning?

279
20:29.640 --> 20:31.480
Eldest Brother, Second Brother.

280
20:31.480 --> 20:32.950
If even one's own flesh and blood

281
20:32.950 --> 20:34.080
can be disregarded,

282
20:34.750 --> 20:36.310
what is the point

283
20:39.440 --> 20:41.300
of sitting on that dragon throne?

284
20:48.400 --> 20:49.200
General,

285
20:49.480 --> 20:50.580
the casualties in Gutan County

286
20:50.580 --> 20:51.740
have been tallied.

287
20:51.830 --> 20:53.550
1,759 civilians have died

288
20:53.640 --> 20:55.200
from the Chiying bugs.

289
20:55.880 --> 20:57.140
Right now, this number

290
20:57.750 --> 20:58.950
is still increasing.

291
21:21.550 --> 21:22.640
The Liluo bandits

292
21:23.270 --> 21:26.350
treat the people of our Great Shi like dirt

293
21:27.830 --> 21:29.430
and slaughter the innocent.

294
21:29.640 --> 21:31.100
Their crimes are heinous.

295
21:32.030 --> 21:33.530
I, Zhou Zhu,

296
21:33.750 --> 21:35.280
will not rest in this life

297
21:35.920 --> 21:37.980
until these bandits are eradicated!

298
21:38.550 --> 21:41.240
Come with me quickly to save the people!

299
21:42.340 --> 21:43.130
Yes!

300
21:48.480 --> 21:49.270
Slow down.

301
21:52.350 --> 21:53.400
Take this away.

302
21:56.960 --> 21:58.270
Thank you, General.

303
22:16.270 --> 22:17.680
The water distributed to the people

304
22:17.680 --> 22:18.790
must be boiled

305
22:18.790 --> 22:19.590
to ensure that

306
22:19.600 --> 22:20.830
it contains no bug venom.

307
22:20.830 --> 22:21.590
Yes.

308
22:41.160 --> 22:41.960
Zhu!

309
22:48.030 --> 22:49.350
Did I hear it wrong?

310
22:51.660 --> 22:52.920
Sit here and rest a bit.

311
22:53.270 --> 22:54.030
Slow down.

312
23:00.610 --> 23:05.600
[Fuguang Studio]

313
23:11.030 --> 23:12.830
This is Abbot Yun Hai's

314
23:12.880 --> 23:14.880
meditation room for his seclusion.

315
23:15.750 --> 23:17.150
Please go ahead, My Lord.

316
23:18.030 --> 23:19.090
Thank you, Master.

317
24:27.720 --> 24:28.510
I'm afraid

318
24:29.200 --> 24:30.920
this is the real Yun Hai.

319
24:38.200 --> 24:39.200
Ode to Canglang?

320
24:44.210 --> 24:44.450
[Ode to Canglang]

321
24:46.440 --> 24:48.000
Inner power is like a giant wave.

322
24:48.000 --> 24:49.510
The sea of qi is like an empty valley.

323
24:49.510 --> 24:51.270
Resists all external attacks

324
24:51.440 --> 24:53.510
and expels all internal things

325
24:53.710 --> 24:56.040
to neutralize all poisons in the world.

326
24:59.070 --> 25:00.240
I see.

327
25:01.680 --> 25:02.480
It seems

328
25:02.590 --> 25:04.520
the martial arts Yin Jie practiced

329
25:04.590 --> 25:06.450
was exactly this Ode to Canglang.

330
25:07.830 --> 25:09.590
When this mental method is mastered,

331
25:09.590 --> 25:10.980
the Kui Wood Wolf constellation

332
25:10.980 --> 25:13.640
will surge forth from the practitioner's back.

333
25:14.310 --> 25:16.160
Since Dao Yin taught me the Severe-Cold Sword,

334
25:16.160 --> 25:17.200
I've had this.

335
25:17.590 --> 25:18.590
Whenever I use my power,

336
25:18.590 --> 25:19.590
it appears.

337
25:21.680 --> 25:23.030
Could it be that the inner power mental method

338
25:23.030 --> 25:24.830
Dao Yin taught Meng Rui back then

339
25:25.480 --> 25:26.880
was also Ode to Canglang?

340
25:27.640 --> 25:28.680
Anyway, until the end,

341
25:28.680 --> 25:30.480
he wouldn't let me call him Master.

342
25:30.480 --> 25:31.400
He said what he taught me

343
25:31.400 --> 25:32.750
wasn't any martial arts,

344
25:32.750 --> 25:34.640
but the way of killing.

345
25:34.830 --> 25:36.160
If that's true,

346
25:36.960 --> 25:38.920
then the bug venom in me must be...

347
25:43.310 --> 25:45.550
Chiying Bug Venom is insidious and overbearing.

348
25:45.550 --> 25:47.410
There is no cure for the poisoned.

349
25:47.960 --> 25:50.160
But if one who practices Ode to Canglang

350
25:50.270 --> 25:52.270
exhausts all their lifelong power,

351
25:52.310 --> 25:54.310
they can help eliminate the toxins.

352
26:00.750 --> 26:02.680
Exhaust all their lifelong power.

353
26:06.060 --> 26:08.120
Exhaust all their lifelong power...

354
26:14.960 --> 26:15.750
Meng Rui.

355
26:16.640 --> 26:18.730
I can't ruin your life

356
26:19.000 --> 26:20.530
for my own selfish desires.

357
26:26.660 --> 26:28.350
Let this Ode to Canglang

358
26:29.030 --> 26:30.880
become a secret forever.

359
26:55.730 --> 26:58.070
[God of Calamity, Qiuyu]

360
27:15.990 --> 27:19.470
[God of Death, Hanluo]

361
27:22.270 --> 27:23.830
There is one god standing.

362
27:25.240 --> 27:28.590
How will the fate of our Great Shi turn out?

363
27:58.310 --> 28:02.990
[Liluo's Scheme Exposed] [The final battle]

364
28:18.890 --> 28:22.440
[Clear as a Mirror]

365
28:25.720 --> 28:28.480
Yun Hai spoke with absolute conviction.

366
28:29.590 --> 28:31.790
Coupled with deliberate rumor-mongering and speculation,

367
28:31.790 --> 28:33.790
the rumors have spread far and wide.

368
28:34.350 --> 28:36.000
The act of dropping Chiying bug eggs

369
28:36.000 --> 28:37.550
to harm the people

370
28:38.200 --> 28:40.310
was all blamed on Prince Ding.

371
28:41.070 --> 28:42.200
They're saying that

372
28:42.270 --> 28:44.920
Prince Ding and Liluo had an agreement.

373
28:44.960 --> 28:46.750
If the attempt failed,

374
28:46.750 --> 28:49.350
they'd use bug eggs to kill the Grand Heir Apparent

375
28:49.350 --> 28:50.480
and ensure the plan's success.

376
28:50.470 --> 28:57.660
[Clear as a Mirror]

377
28:50.640 --> 28:52.570
Yin Jie hated Great Shi to the bone.

378
28:52.590 --> 28:53.480
He was

379
28:53.720 --> 28:56.440
using Liluo to take personal revenge

380
28:56.440 --> 28:57.960
and trigger internal strife.

381
28:57.960 --> 28:59.960
Shaking the Great Shi Empire's court

382
28:59.960 --> 29:01.820
was Liluo's overt plot all along.

383
29:09.300 --> 29:11.630
[Investigation Record of the Bureau]

384
29:10.350 --> 29:11.750
It's been 7 days since

385
29:11.960 --> 29:13.550
we returned from Gutan County.

386
29:13.550 --> 29:14.750
What did His Majesty

387
29:15.000 --> 29:15.860
say about this?

388
29:19.550 --> 29:20.310
Your Majesty.

389
29:19.850 --> 29:22.670
[Report on the Investigation into the Gutan County Massacre]

390
29:21.160 --> 29:23.220
This is the entire sequence of events

391
29:23.480 --> 29:24.920
of the Gutan County case.

392
29:29.750 --> 29:30.790
Rebellious son!

393
29:31.550 --> 29:34.270
Rebellious son!

394
29:37.720 --> 29:38.400
Your Majesty!

395
29:38.400 --> 29:39.160
Your Majesty!

396
29:39.160 --> 29:40.880
Summon the imperial physician! Hurry!

397
29:40.880 --> 29:41.270
Yes.

398
29:41.270 --> 29:42.550
Hurry, summon the imperial physician!

399
29:42.550 --> 29:43.350
Your Majesty!

400
29:45.830 --> 29:46.640
Your Majesty.

401
29:54.790 --> 29:56.440
My fourth son.

402
29:56.590 --> 29:58.350
If he were still alive,

403
29:59.900 --> 30:04.260
he should have already established himself by now.

404
30:15.720 --> 30:18.100
Ye was just like Yan.

405
30:18.200 --> 30:19.200
Since childhood,

406
30:21.590 --> 30:23.240
he loved to pester me

407
30:24.070 --> 30:25.800
to weave grasshoppers for him.

408
30:27.550 --> 30:28.720
But from now on,

409
30:29.640 --> 30:30.960
who else can I weave

410
30:31.730 --> 30:33.820
my grasshoppers for?

411
30:38.000 --> 30:39.460
The Fourth Prince is gone.

412
30:40.350 --> 30:41.950
What about the Third Prince?

413
30:41.990 --> 30:46.830
[Uphold the Martial Legacy]

414
30:42.160 --> 30:43.440
After all, his mother

415
30:44.960 --> 30:47.160
is from the southern barbarian tribes.

416
30:48.160 --> 30:51.160
He doesn't have the pure bloodline of Great Shi.

417
30:52.480 --> 30:55.200
I only have the eldest son and the Crown Prince.

418
31:03.830 --> 31:04.680
Shan,

419
31:05.680 --> 31:07.960
if I depose them,

420
31:09.720 --> 31:11.030
who should I pass

421
31:11.350 --> 31:12.240
my empire

422
31:12.830 --> 31:14.720
and throne to?

423
31:16.160 --> 31:18.840
His Majesty didn't inquire

424
31:18.860 --> 31:20.790
about the investigation results.

425
31:23.000 --> 31:24.790
Is he suppressing the truth

426
31:25.160 --> 31:27.000
for the dignity of Great Shi again?

427
31:27.000 --> 31:28.600
Is what happened 17 years ago

428
31:28.830 --> 31:30.550
going to repeat itself?

429
31:31.740 --> 31:34.390
[Grand Heir Apparent Zhou Ye's Spirit Tablet]

430
31:31.880 --> 31:32.680
Ye,

431
31:33.030 --> 31:34.200
don't blame me.

432
31:34.720 --> 31:36.640
I'm just borrowing your body.

433
31:38.350 --> 31:39.510
Just borrowing it.

434
31:42.160 --> 31:43.160
Even if the Divine Constable Bureau

435
31:43.160 --> 31:45.160
wants to examine the body, so what?

436
31:45.240 --> 31:46.680
You died of illness.

437
31:47.350 --> 31:48.880
I didn't kill you.

438
31:49.240 --> 31:51.200
Besides, for the sake of the court,

439
31:52.550 --> 31:54.750
Father will only let you die of illness.

440
31:54.830 --> 31:55.640
Right?

441
32:04.030 --> 32:05.350
They won't find out.

442
32:05.960 --> 32:06.720
God bless.

443
32:06.830 --> 32:07.750
They won't be able to trace it back to me.

444
32:07.750 --> 32:09.080
They won't find out.

445
32:09.160 --> 32:10.590
Even if they do, so what?

446
32:10.720 --> 32:12.030
So what?

447
32:12.350 --> 32:13.960
Father won't punish me.

448
32:13.960 --> 32:15.000
He won't punish me.

449
32:15.000 --> 32:15.960
He won't punish me.

450
32:15.960 --> 32:16.790
It's Zhou Miao.

451
32:16.790 --> 32:17.880
He's the one who killed you,

452
32:17.880 --> 32:18.750
not me.

453
32:18.880 --> 32:20.750
So the position of Crown Prince is still mine.

454
32:20.750 --> 32:21.550
That's right!

455
32:21.720 --> 32:23.480
The position of Crown Prince is still mine!

456
32:23.480 --> 32:24.720
Still mine!

457
32:24.960 --> 32:26.790
The throne is still mine!

458
32:25.430 --> 32:29.060
[Grand Heir Apparent Zhou Ye's Spirit Tablet]

459
32:27.200 --> 32:28.200
It's mine...

460
32:28.590 --> 32:29.400
It's mine.

461
32:29.400 --> 32:30.260
Your Highness.

462
32:30.310 --> 32:31.170
Your Highness!

463
32:31.720 --> 32:32.580
Your Highness.

464
32:34.030 --> 32:34.830
How is it?

465
32:34.960 --> 32:36.560
Have you found Lou Tianming?

466
32:37.160 --> 32:38.440
Did the people from the Divine Constable Bureau

467
32:38.440 --> 32:39.070
find out

468
32:39.070 --> 32:40.730
who sent those two assassins?

469
32:42.200 --> 32:43.800
Reporting to Your Highness,

470
32:43.880 --> 32:45.590
when the Grand Heir Apparent was murdered,

471
32:45.590 --> 32:47.590
both assassins were already dead.

472
32:48.160 --> 32:48.960
So,

473
32:49.350 --> 32:51.030
there's no evidence.

474
32:52.070 --> 32:53.590
Everyone heard

475
32:54.070 --> 32:55.270
them say...

476
32:55.480 --> 32:56.270
Say what?

477
32:56.680 --> 32:57.480
Speak!

478
32:58.200 --> 33:02.070
They said they were instructed by Your Highness.

479
33:02.090 --> 33:03.240
Nonsense!

480
33:03.270 --> 33:04.550
I didn't send them!

481
33:06.000 --> 33:07.720
Lou Tianming wants to frame me!

482
33:07.720 --> 33:08.780
It's Lou Tianming!

483
33:09.240 --> 33:10.680
Find Lou Tianming for me.

484
33:10.880 --> 33:12.440
Find Lou Tianming for me!

485
33:12.480 --> 33:13.270
Yes.

486
33:13.480 --> 33:14.680
Hurry up!

487
33:14.680 --> 33:15.680
Yes, yes.

488
33:16.030 --> 33:17.030
I didn't do it.

489
33:17.350 --> 33:18.310
I didn't do it.

490
33:18.440 --> 33:19.640
I'm going to tell Father.

491
33:19.640 --> 33:20.770
I'm going to tell...

492
33:25.590 --> 33:27.070
Why would he believe me?

493
33:28.200 --> 33:29.240
I didn't do it.

494
33:33.400 --> 33:35.400
It's just like what happened 17 years ago.

495
33:35.400 --> 33:37.060
History is repeating itself.

496
33:37.160 --> 33:39.060
Father won't punish me.

497
33:40.680 --> 33:42.480
Father won't punish me.

498
33:45.440 --> 33:47.200
Father won't punish me...

499
33:54.730 --> 33:57.130
Mother said that your leg is hurting again.

500
33:58.480 --> 34:01.140
Father, eat slowly.

501
34:01.200 --> 34:02.000
Okay.

502
34:06.480 --> 34:07.420
As I get older,

503
34:07.440 --> 34:09.489
my body is bound to feel a bit unwell.

504
34:15.389 --> 34:17.989
Thinking about the Grand Heir Apparent again?

505
34:19.280 --> 34:21.880
No one knows a daughter better than her father.

506
34:24.710 --> 34:25.710
Drink some water.

507
34:25.710 --> 34:26.920
I just feel that

508
34:27.440 --> 34:29.800
the Grand Heir Apparent and the Crown Princess

509
34:29.800 --> 34:31.190
are truly pitiful.

510
34:33.840 --> 34:34.630
Father,

511
34:34.880 --> 34:36.230
how do you think

512
34:36.280 --> 34:38.340
His Majesty will handle it this time?

513
34:40.670 --> 34:42.230
Being in a high position,

514
34:43.150 --> 34:45.610
there are many things one is helpless about.

515
34:46.280 --> 34:47.630
But the truth

516
34:47.960 --> 34:49.960
will ultimately be uncovered.

517
34:51.030 --> 34:51.960
Don't ask

518
34:51.960 --> 34:53.360
what shouldn't be asked.

519
35:00.780 --> 35:02.120
You know,

520
35:02.480 --> 35:04.030
this Star-Gathering Pavilion

521
35:04.030 --> 35:05.490
is still as lively as ever.

522
35:10.030 --> 35:10.840
Daughter,

523
35:11.070 --> 35:12.590
I heard that

524
35:12.710 --> 35:15.190
Li Qingyang has returned.

525
35:17.280 --> 35:18.070
Father,

526
35:18.550 --> 35:19.670
don't ask

527
35:20.030 --> 35:21.430
what shouldn't be asked.

528
35:24.030 --> 35:25.050
Okay, okay.

529
35:25.400 --> 35:26.770
I won't ask.

530
35:33.550 --> 35:37.750
By the mandate of Heaven, the Emperor decrees:

531
35:37.960 --> 35:40.670
I have inherited the grand design

532
35:38.390 --> 35:43.300
[Yu'an Hall]

533
35:40.960 --> 35:42.840
and reign over all lands

534
35:43.800 --> 35:45.880
with the peace of the state

535
35:45.880 --> 35:48.880
and the prosperity of descendants in mind.

536
35:49.510 --> 35:51.390
The Grand Heir Apparent Ye

537
35:51.550 --> 35:53.510
was endowed with exceptional gifts and a refined character.

538
35:53.510 --> 35:55.230
He was filial and gentle.

539
35:55.800 --> 35:57.440
Since his establishment,

540
35:57.670 --> 35:59.530
he had been diligent and prudent.

541
36:00.070 --> 36:02.400
His benevolence and virtue were increasingly evident,

542
36:02.400 --> 36:04.550
deeply comforting my heart.

543
36:03.510 --> 36:06.540
♪ Capture my heart ♪

544
36:05.510 --> 36:08.190
He was truly a fine talent for the state,

545
36:07.140 --> 36:10.400
♪ Unravel my longing ♪

546
36:08.670 --> 36:11.070
and the hope of the ancestral temple.

547
36:11.440 --> 36:16.720
♪ Can we relive the mark you once carved deep? ♪

548
36:11.670 --> 36:14.480
However, Heaven was merciless.

549
36:14.960 --> 36:17.960
The Grand Heir Apparent fell severely ill.

550
36:17.270 --> 36:20.600
♪ Turns out every soul ♪

551
36:18.150 --> 36:20.000
No medicine could cure him,

552
36:20.150 --> 36:22.550
and he passed away in the Eastern Palace.

553
36:21.160 --> 36:24.430
♪ Fears deep devotion ♪

554
36:23.000 --> 36:25.000
My heart mourns deeply,

555
36:25.070 --> 36:26.960
and I hurt as if my organs were ruptured.

556
36:25.390 --> 36:31.330
♪ In a moment, I fell, a lifetime left to heal ♪

557
36:27.480 --> 36:28.550
I am deeply

558
36:28.960 --> 36:30.110
devastated.

559
36:31.790 --> 36:34.760
♪ Tossing and turning through endless nights ♪

560
36:33.670 --> 36:35.760
What a convenient "fell severely ill"

561
36:35.570 --> 36:38.670
♪ Breaking free from a labyrinth ♪

562
36:36.230 --> 36:38.090
and "no medicine could cure him."

563
36:39.480 --> 36:40.840
Zhou Ye, oh, Zhou Ye.

564
36:39.810 --> 36:45.080
♪ Will we meet again, those I dare not face? ♪

565
36:41.840 --> 36:45.300
No matter how much your Grandfather doted on you and loved you,

566
36:45.890 --> 36:48.840
♪ One thought to ferry me across the sea of suffering ♪

567
36:46.280 --> 36:48.540
you still ended up in the same ambiguous,

568
36:48.880 --> 36:50.480
wretched state as me.

569
36:49.600 --> 36:52.700
♪ One thought to burn me to ash ♪

570
36:53.900 --> 36:59.690
♪ A thousand schemes can never be enough, till all turn to dust ♪

571
37:00.140 --> 37:03.200
♪ Dare not forget ♪

572
37:03.970 --> 37:07.060
♪ No regret, no blame ♪

573
37:05.670 --> 37:06.480
Ye.

574
37:07.630 --> 37:08.440
This toast is for you...

575
37:07.870 --> 37:14.130
♪ In love, I fear neither life nor death ♪

576
37:09.440 --> 37:10.920
as your fourth uncle.

577
37:14.900 --> 37:17.960
♪ Dare not think ♪

578
37:18.210 --> 37:21.170
♪ Who was it that cast the spell? ♪

579
37:20.250 --> 37:22.400
If the truth is covered up like this,

580
37:22.180 --> 37:28.450
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

581
37:22.920 --> 37:24.320
then who can give the people of the world

582
37:24.320 --> 37:25.280
justice?

583
37:25.710 --> 37:26.550
Father,

584
37:26.300 --> 37:27.990
[Tavern]

585
37:26.960 --> 37:28.290
since you can't give it,

586
37:28.410 --> 37:29.540
I will.

587
37:30.150 --> 37:34.110
♪ Forever within your shadow by your side ♪

588
37:33.970 --> 37:36.380
[Yu'an Hall]

589
37:35.400 --> 37:38.110
We have received great favor from Your Majesty.

590
37:38.670 --> 37:40.230
Therefore, we should be loyal

591
37:40.230 --> 37:41.920
and advise Your Majesty.

592
37:42.670 --> 37:44.280
If the ruler’s conduct is improper,

593
37:44.280 --> 37:45.880
the minister has failed in his duty.

594
37:45.880 --> 37:48.250
How can we remain silent, Your Majesty?

595
37:52.800 --> 37:55.230
If the ruler’s conduct is improper,

596
37:55.280 --> 37:57.150
the minister has failed in his duty.

597
37:57.150 --> 37:59.920
How can we remain silent, Your Majesty?

598
38:01.030 --> 38:03.510
If the ruler’s conduct is improper,

599
38:03.800 --> 38:05.630
the minister has failed in his duty.

600
38:05.630 --> 38:08.500
How can we remain silent, Your Majesty?

601
38:22.280 --> 38:23.320
My Lords,

602
38:23.590 --> 38:25.280
His Majesty is unwell today.

603
38:25.280 --> 38:27.670
Please go back.

604
38:29.070 --> 38:31.070
If His Majesty

605
38:31.070 --> 38:32.670
insists on not seeing us today,

606
38:32.670 --> 38:34.230
I will

607
38:34.230 --> 38:36.230
smash my head on these jade steps!

608
38:38.190 --> 38:39.000
This...

609
38:53.030 --> 38:53.920
Third Brother,

610
38:54.440 --> 38:56.100
watch your words and actions.

611
38:56.550 --> 38:58.280
It's not directed at you today.

612
38:58.300 --> 39:00.220
Why stick your neck out?

613
39:00.880 --> 39:02.480
After all these years,

614
39:02.480 --> 39:03.400
haven't you learned

615
39:03.400 --> 39:05.360
the proper etiquette before the Emperor?

616
39:05.360 --> 39:06.400
Etiquette

617
39:07.190 --> 39:08.230
is based on benevolence

618
39:08.230 --> 39:09.360
and righteousness.

619
39:10.070 --> 39:11.710
Without benevolence and righteousness,

620
39:11.710 --> 39:14.040
when the people are treated like animals,

621
39:15.820 --> 39:17.820
what etiquette is there to speak of?

622
39:22.330 --> 39:24.080
Your Majesty!

623
39:24.920 --> 39:26.010
No!

624
39:31.190 --> 39:31.980
My Lord.

625
39:34.150 --> 39:34.880
Li Qingyang?

626
39:34.880 --> 39:35.740
Sit down first.

627
39:36.590 --> 39:37.400
Qingyang,

628
39:37.670 --> 39:39.000
what are you doing here?

629
39:39.400 --> 39:40.840
How dare you break into the Yuque

630
39:40.840 --> 39:42.480
without being summoned?

631
39:42.550 --> 39:43.360
Qingyang,

632
39:43.480 --> 39:44.340
leave quickly.

633
39:44.840 --> 39:45.590
Guards,

634
39:45.590 --> 39:46.410
arrest him!

635
39:46.440 --> 39:47.230
Wait!

636
39:52.550 --> 39:53.880
We must first figure out

637
39:54.280 --> 39:56.480
why Divine Constable Qingyang is here.

638
40:01.960 --> 40:02.710
My Lord,

639
40:03.030 --> 40:04.630
don't be so reckless again.

640
40:04.820 --> 40:06.340
Rest well first.

641
40:11.280 --> 40:12.590
Who is this person?

642
40:13.190 --> 40:14.760
I've never seen him before.

643
40:21.630 --> 40:22.960
Divine Constable Qingyang,

644
40:22.960 --> 40:23.710
do you know

645
40:23.710 --> 40:26.110
the consequences of trespassing in Yuque?

646
40:32.960 --> 40:33.840
Eunuch Guo.

647
40:34.440 --> 40:35.840
I have an item

648
40:36.440 --> 40:37.900
that I would like to ask you

649
40:38.960 --> 40:40.420
to present to His Majesty.

650
41:11.960 --> 41:13.160
Divine Constable Li,

651
41:13.710 --> 41:14.550
please wait.

652
41:18.370 --> 41:21.370
[Yu'an Hall]

653
41:35.930 --> 41:41.790
[Yu'an Hall]

654
41:57.670 --> 41:58.480
Your Majesty,

655
41:59.480 --> 42:01.110
I have a request.

656
42:03.230 --> 42:05.000
No matter what I say,

657
42:05.280 --> 42:07.610
Your Majesty must take care of your health

658
42:08.250 --> 42:09.800
and not get worked up.

659
42:11.150 --> 42:11.960
Please...

660
42:12.800 --> 42:14.030
Have a look.

661
42:47.070 --> 42:47.960
Your Majesty,

662
42:49.580 --> 42:50.910
the Fourth Highness...

663
42:52.240 --> 42:56.220
The Fourth Highness you've been longing for,

664
42:56.340 --> 42:59.950
[Yan]

665
42:57.440 --> 42:58.960
has returned.

666
43:05.670 --> 43:06.670
Yan?

667
43:07.280 --> 43:09.070
He has returned!

668
43:16.430 --> 43:18.540
[Yan]

669
43:16.550 --> 43:17.360
That's great!

670
43:17.360 --> 43:19.400
The grasshopper Father made me

671
43:19.550 --> 43:22.070
is the most beautiful in the world!

672
43:21.820 --> 43:24.700
[Breezes of Auspices]

673
43:23.400 --> 43:24.590
I will weave a hundred grasshoppers

674
43:24.590 --> 43:26.150
for you, Yan.

675
43:26.150 --> 43:27.350
Grasshoppers!

676
43:29.710 --> 43:30.760
It's him.

677
43:32.840 --> 43:34.000
It's Yan.

678
43:35.930 --> 43:38.790
Yan is back!

679
43:39.190 --> 43:40.880
Open the doors. Hurry!

680
43:41.190 --> 43:42.760
By His Majesty's verbal decree!

681
43:42.760 --> 43:43.560
Summoning...

682
43:48.000 --> 43:49.670
By His Majesty's verbal decree,

683
43:49.670 --> 43:51.330
summoning the Fourth Prince,

684
43:51.630 --> 43:53.700
Zhou Yan, for an audience!

685
44:05.550 --> 44:06.320
Zhou Yan?

686
44:10.590 --> 44:12.010
The Fourth Prince?

687
44:12.960 --> 44:13.920
Eunuch Guo,

688
44:14.480 --> 44:16.140
are you old and senile,

689
44:16.400 --> 44:18.360
or deaf and hard of hearing?

690
44:19.880 --> 44:22.150
The crime of forging an imperial decree...

691
44:22.150 --> 44:23.880
Can you bear the consequences?

692
44:24.960 --> 44:26.030
Are you kidding me?

693
44:26.280 --> 44:27.360
Say it again!

694
44:27.880 --> 44:29.150
Say it!

695
44:55.150 --> 44:56.590
I knew I felt a special connection

696
44:56.590 --> 44:58.440
when I first met you.

697
45:07.960 --> 45:08.890
Eldest Brother.

698
45:13.190 --> 45:14.120
Second Brother.

699
45:14.440 --> 45:15.370
Fourth Brother.

700
45:21.150 --> 45:22.670
After 17 years,

701
45:23.630 --> 45:24.710
we are finally

702
45:27.280 --> 45:28.710
reunited.

703
45:48.360 --> 45:49.220
Third Brother.

704
46:06.760 --> 46:07.550
Eunuch Guo.

705
46:08.440 --> 46:09.440
At your service.

706
46:09.630 --> 46:10.840
Follow me to see His Majesty.

707
46:10.840 --> 46:11.630
Yes.

708
46:12.550 --> 46:13.360
Open the doors!
